    "title": "HD Textures for Minecraft",
    "description": "Play with real textures and HD resources in Minecraft (Bedrock). This app allows you to download automatically more than 10 different texture packs that make original game ultra realistric and look ultra quality\r\n\r\nHD Textures for Minecraft features: \r\n\u2705 All mods for make a real gaming crafting experience: shaders, realistic water, seus mod and realistic cubes\r\n\u2705 RTX Mod for Minecraft PE\r\n\u2705 10+ different texture packs and 3D resources pack for Minecraft PE\r\n\r\nList of texture packs and shaders.\r\n\r\n- <b>Simple Shader (Previously SSPEShader)</b>. It's a lightweight shader pack which is the perfect solution for anyone who have got a low-end device and haven\u2019t been able to use any of the other shader packs. \r\n- <b>Realistic Shaders [16x16]</b>. This shaders pack is the perfect addition to make the game look a lot more realistic and alive. One of the really cool features make it look as if wind was blowing in the grass and leaves causing them to move.\r\n- <b>Misa's Realistic [64x64]</b>. Misa\u2019s Realistic is a high detailed texture pack. Everything about is looks pretty good. We\u2019ve got new textures for mods, blocks and the user interface.\r\n- Much more!\r\n\r\nPlay your favourite craft game with real textures, 3D resources and real behavior in Minecraft PE (Bedrock).\r\n\r\n~ Disclaimer ~\r\nThis application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB. The Minecraft Name, Brand, and Minecraft Assets are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner. All rights reserved. In accordance with http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines\r\n\r\nRealistic Minecraft texture packs mod contains all the necessary elements to make your game more realistic. Enjoy it with these collection of mods and addons.\r\n\r\nPlay with real HD textures and ultra  shaders effects for Minecraft Bedrock Edition!",
